                        Career Highlights ","id":577},{"type":2,"tagName":"i","attributes":{"class":"fa fa-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"childNodes":[],"id":578},{"type":3,"textContent":"
                    ","id":579}],"id":576},{"type":3,"textContent":"
                    ","id":580},{"type":2,"tagName":"p","attributes":{"class":"section-intro"},"childNodes":[{"type":3,"textContent":"A few of the problems I've been handed over the years, and what happened
                        next. Names and logos left out on purpose — the interesting part is the work.","id":582}],"id":581},{"type":3,"textContent":"
