                        ","id":728},{"type":2,"tagName":"li","attributes":{},"childNodes":[{"type":3,"textContent":"Tracked a stubborn cursor-jump bug deep into a third-party editor's internals and shipped a
                            fix for users without forking the whole library.","id":730}],"id":729},{"type":3,"textContent":"
                        ","id":731},{"type":2,"tagName":"li","attributes":{},"childNodes":[{"type":3,"textContent":"Worked cross-functionally with architects to build and debug internal application tooling,
                            including the build pipeline and bundler configuration behind a shared React starter.","id":733}],"id":732},{"type":3,"textContent":"
                        ","id":734},{"type":2,"tagName":"li","attributes":{},"childNodes":[{"type":3,"textContent":"Rebuilt my own approach to sprint planning early in a role — going deep on refinement
