                        ","id":776},{"type":2,"tagName":"p","attributes":{},"childNodes":[{"type":3,"textContent":"A snapshot of my capstone projects from bootcamp in 2017. These were originally hosted on
                            Heroku and are no longer actively deployed, so the images below stand in for the live
                            sites. They're here to show projects I owned start to finish, very early on.","id":778}],"id":777},{"type":3,"textContent":"
